sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant P as PIR sensors
    participant S as Show (state machine)
    participant G as LED glasses
    participant A as Speaker
    participant C as Camera + face detector
    participant D as Display

    V->>P: walks up
    P->>S: motion
    S->>G: awake scene (green comets)
    S->>A: "awaken" sound / boss line
    S->>C: start watching
    C->>S: face found
    S->>G: eyes follow the face, lock-on turns them red
    S->>A: "hold still!" (boss line)
    S->>D: HOLD STILL! card
    Note over S: face held 4 s
    S->>G: countdown (rings fill white)
    S->>G: flash
    C->>S: best face frame
    S->>S: ScarySmile (≈1.5 s, background thread)
    S->>D: scary photo
    S->>A: scream / boss line
    S->>G: strobe, then fire flicker
    Note over S,D: photo stays 12 s, then back to idle
